e application of hundreds of small dots of pure unmixed pigment that are perceived by the viewer\u2019s eye as variegated mixed colours. The light ground shining through between the dots lends the picture luminosity. In this way, Toorop obtained the effect of translucency in this mysterious, tenuous seascape.", "classified_as": [{"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300048722", "type": "Type"}]}, {"type": "LinguisticObject", "part": [{"id": "_:b6", "type": "Name", "content": "Misty Sea", "classified_as": [{"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300417207", "type": "Type"}, {"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670", "type": "Type"}], "language": [{"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300388277", "type": "Language"}]}, {"type": "LinguisticObject", "content": "Jan Toorop (1858-1928), oil on canvas, 1899"}], "classified_as": [{"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300312075", "type": "Type"}]}], "classified_as": [{"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670", "type": "Type"}, {"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300417268", "type": "Type"}], "language": [{"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300388277", "type": "Language"}]}, {"id": "https://data.rijksmuseum.nl/200100988", "type": "LinguisticObject", "subject_to": [{"type": "Right", "classified_as": [{"id": "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/", "type": "Type"}]}], "classified_as": [{"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300379475", "type": "Type"}]}, {"type": "LinguisticObject", "language": [{"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300388256", "type": "Language"}], "digitally_carried_by": [{"type": "DigitalObject", "format": "text/html", "classified_as": [{"id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264578", "type": "Type"}], "access_point": [{"id": "https://www.rijksmuseum.nl/nl/collectie/object/SK-C-1726--d6666ce4b09b319db68940ed0db5573b", "type": "DigitalObject"}]}]}, {"type": "LinguisticObject", "part": [{"type": "LinguisticObject", "part": [{"type": "LinguisticObject", "content": "Jan Toorop (1858-1928), olieverf op doek, 1899"}, {